### 3. `HttpClient` 方法签名

路径：`packages/core/core_network/lib/src/service/http_client_interface.dart`

```46:91:packages/core/core_network/lib/src/service/http_client_interface.dart
abstract class HttpClient {
  Future<Result<HttpResponse>> get(
    String path, {
    Map<String, String>? headers,
    Map<String, dynamic>? queryParameters,
    NetworkRequestOptions? options,
  });
  Future<Result<HttpResponse>> post(
    String path, {
    Map<String, String>? headers,
    Object? body,
    NetworkRequestOptions? options,
  });
  Future<Result<HttpResponse>> put(...);
  Future<Result<HttpResponse>> delete(...);
  Future<Result<HttpResponse>> upload(...);
  Stream<String> streamPost(...);
  void addNetworkInterceptor(NetworkInterceptor interceptor);
  void addInterceptor(HttpInterceptor interceptor);
  void updateBaseUrl(String baseUrl);
}
```

- **不抛业务异常**：返回 `Result<HttpResponse>`。
- `HttpResponse`：`statusCode` / `body`（`String`）/ `headers`。
- POST body：`Object?`（auth 里通常是 `Map`）。
- GET query：`queryParameters`；POST 无独立 query 参数（可用 `options.queryParameters`）。

实现：`DioHttpClient` 在 `packages/core/core_network/lib/src/impl/dio_http_client.dart`。

